*   **`[{'name': 'text_to_speech', 'arguments': {...}}]`**: This indicates that the AI is calling a "text\_to\_speech" tool.
*   **`{'text': '...', 'voice': 'neutral'}`**:  These are the arguments being passed to the text-to-speech tool:
